IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `nt-provisions`
IMPORT `nt-part4-definitions`

-- Tests of nt-part4-definitions.l4, section 17.
-- The first block is mechanical: one assertion for each definition, that the term is found and found at the line the script read it from.
-- The second block is mechanical too: one assertion for each pointer to a provision of this Act, that the provision is in the provision index.
-- The remaining blocks are hand-written from the text of section 17, each with the line of the text beside it.

