§ `Counts`

-- The section defines 133 terms in all: 88 by "means", 2 by "means ... and includes", 15 by "includes", 14 by a pointer into this Act, 5 by "has the same meaning as in", and 9 by "see".
#ASSERT count `definitions in section 17` EQUALS 133
#ASSERT `s 17: the definition printed for the term` "unicorn" EQUALS NOTHING
