§ `Adult and infant, with the reckoning of age in section 30`

-- Born 16 July 2007: the 18th anniversary is 16 July 2025.
#ASSERT `s 17 "adult": the person is an adult on the day` TRUE (Date 16 7 2007) (Date 16 7 2025) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 17 "adult": the person is an adult on the day` TRUE (Date 16 7 2007) (Date 15 7 2025) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 17 "adult": the person is an adult on the day` FALSE (Date 16 7 2007) (Date 16 7 2025) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 17 "infant": the person is an infant on the day` (Date 16 7 2007) (Date 15 7 2025) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 17 "infant": the person is an infant on the day` (Date 16 7 2007) (Date 16 7 2025) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Born 29 February 2008: in a year that is not a leap year the anniversary is 28 February (section 30(3)).
#ASSERT `s 17 "adult": the person is an adult on the day` TRUE (Date 29 2 2008) (Date 28 2 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 17 "adult": the person is an adult on the day` TRUE (Date 29 2 2008) (Date 27 2 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 17 "infant": the person is an infant on the day` (Date 29 2 2008) (Date 27 2 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 17 "individual": the person is an individual` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 17 "individual": the person is an individual` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

